sequenceDiagram
    box Production Environment (docker-compose.prod.yaml)
    participant ProdDB as SQL Server 2022<br/>Biergarten Database<br/>no host port published
    participant ProdMig as Migrations (run-once)
    participant ProdAPI as API Container<br/>ASP.NET Core 10<br/>:8080 HTTP / :8081 HTTPS
    end

    ProdMig-->>ProdDB: depends_on
    ProdMig->>ProdDB: Run migrations
    ProdAPI-->>ProdDB: depends_on: sql-server healthy (not migrations/seed)
    ProdAPI->>ProdDB: Connect and serve
